    <h1 class="display gr-title">The Green Room FAQs</h1>
    <div class="gr-intro">
      <p>The Green Room is about connecting actors and stage management from across the country. Our main aim is to combat isolation to give people a space to connect and have meaningful interactions with strangers.</p>
      <p>We understand that this experience is predicated on how another person chooses to act.</p>
      <p>With that in mind, please act with care and compassion!</p>
    </div>
